sequenceDiagram
  actor V as Visitor
  participant B as Browser
  participant A as app.js
  participant D as translations.js (window.I18N)
  participant S as localStorage
  V->>B: open projects.html?lang=kk
  B->>A: DOMContentLoaded
  A->>A: detectLang(): URL param, then storage, then browser language, then en
  A->>D: t(lang, key) for each [data-i18n]
  D-->>A: text (falls back to en if key missing)
  A->>B: textContent, html lang, title, meta description, aria-pressed
  A->>S: safeSet("lang") inside try/catch
  A->>B: replaceState(?lang=kk), internal links get ?lang=kk
  V->>B: click RU button
  B->>A: click handler
  A->>D: t("ru", key)
  A->>B: update page without reload
  V->>B: click link "Contact"
  B->>B: load contact.html?lang=ru (language kept)
